This is a search results in slider view with image plugin.

== Description ==
This plugin creates a widget,which helps you to upload image from backend through wordpress widget. It consists of one title field,images uploader 
field,textarea field and a link field.Developed by <a target="_blank" href="http://itobuz.com/">Pratyay Chakraborty,ITOBUZ TECH</a>



== Installation ==

1. Go to plugin>add new and upload image_upload.zip
1. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
1. Then go to Appearance->Widgets->add the Easy Image Uploader Widget in any of the sidebar.
1. Add title,content,link & upload the image.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= How do I display my images in the front end ? =

After activation of the plugin go to wordpress widget section,then add the widget in the position where you exactly want to display in your site.

